{
  "slug": "mosaic",
  "name": "Mosaic",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DCVE methodology for systematic project planning, and Discuss for multi-perspective debate and decision-making — both powered by Claude Code agent teams",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `assemble` (Bootstrap a Claude Code agent team for an existing project by scanning code and interviewing the user), `dcve` (Structured design-to-implementation process for complex projects), `discuss` (Multi-perspective discussion and debate for decision-making)\n- **Commands** (3): `run-assemble` (Bootstrap a Claude Code agent team for an existing codebase by scanning the repo and interviewing the user), `run-dcve` (Start a DCVE (Devise-Curate-Verify-Execute) cycle for systematic project planning and execution with agent teams), `run-discuss` (Start a multi-perspective discussion and debate for decision-making with agent teams)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mosaic@claude-community` from `factorshin/mosaic`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
